OL,3,GNEWSABrother of Kriss Donald killers
OL,4,Aamong gang jailed for #600,000 fraud
OL,5,Aplot
OL,6,
OL,7,FTHE brother of two of the race-hate
OL,8,Fkillers of teenager Kriss Donald has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for 10-and-a-half years for
OL,10,Fhis role in a #600,000 fraud plot.
OL,12,FAhsan Shahid was part of a gang who
OL,13,Fduped 48 elderly people aged between 64
OL,14,Fand 95 by posing as police or bank
OL,15,Finvestigators.
OL,17,FThe swindle saw the victims being told
OL,18,Ftheir accounts were at threat of
OL,19,Fscammers, with Shahid and his
OL,20,Fassociates securing cash, Rolex
OL,21,Fwatches, designer clothes, Apple
OL,22,Fproducts, and an e-bike.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
