OL,4,Aamong gang jailed for #600,000 fraud
OL,5,Aplot
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 41-year-old had earlier pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty along with Sean Singh, 21, and
OL,9,FDuncan Currie, 42, to being involved
OL,10,Fwith one another and other unnamed
OL,11,Findividuals in "fraudulent schemes".
